  "scope": "Explicit whole-source ownership accounts only for contributions proven to originate in that exact target/source/hash. Mixed sources use selected C++ scopes, exact named members, exact DIA class parents or exact observed free-template function names. PDB declarations require matching physical source and all overlapping aliases, without template-argument inference. Optimizer merges, section gaps and runtime lifecycle acceptance remain separate evidence.",
